OL,3,GNEWSARare manx shearwaters returned to
OL,4,AIsle of Canna in bird conservation bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservationists are trying to
OL,7,Fre-establish a population of rare manx
OL,8,Fshearwaters on the Isle of Canna.
OL,10,FThe island in the Small Isles, off the
OL,11,Fwest of Scotland, had as many as 3,000
OL,12,Fbreeding adult birds, but the colony
OL,13,Fwas devastated by a rat infestation.
OL,15,FRats were eradicated on Canna in 2005,
OL,16,Fand National Trust for Scotland (NTS)
OL,17,Fhas now moved 40 young manx shearwaters
OL,18,Fto the island from the nearby Isle of
OL,19,FRum.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
